function roadRoute(from,to){const available=[];for(let ix=0;ix<8;ix++)for(let iy=0;iy<8;iy++)if([0,1,2,3].some(d=>edgeValid(ix,iy,d)))available.push({ix,iy,x:OFFSET+ix*STEP,y:OFFSET+iy*STEP});const near=p=>available.reduce((a,b)=>dist(a,p)<dist(b,p)?a:b);const a=near(from),b=near(to),key=p=>p.ix+','+p.iy,queue=[a],previous=new Map([[key(a),null]]);let end=null;while(queue.length){const n=queue.shift();if(key(n)===key(b)){end=n;break;}for(let d=0;d<4;d++){if(!edgeValid(n.ix,n.iy,d))continue;const v={ix:n.ix+dx[d],iy:n.iy+dy[d]};v.x=OFFSET+v.ix*STEP;v.y=OFFSET+v.iy*STEP;if(!previous.has(key(v))){previous.set(key(v),n);queue.push(v);}}}if(!end)return [];const path=[to];while(end){path.push(end);end=previous.get(key(end));}path.push(from);return path.reverse();}
